ICOOR_INTERNAL   UPPER -160.106947   62.660329    1.349792   C     CA    N  
ICOOR_INTERNAL    O   -180.000000   59.200005    1.231015   C     CA  UPPER
ICOOR_INTERNAL   1HA2  119.349069   71.074925    1.085064   CA    N     C  
ICOOR_INTERNAL   2HA2  117.587394   71.017432    1.077288   CA    N    1HA2
